From de0cbf2fe553d14a7423fc2ba072329249134d25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Shuhao Zhang (Tony)" <5267690+ShuhaoZhangTony@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 05:17:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sparsity): harden experimental activation paths

Require explicit, calibrated opt-in and fail closed for unsupported runtime combinations. Repair dense model wiring and preserve La RoSA rotation semantics when sparse-kernel admission falls back.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex
Signed-off-by: Shuhao Zhang (Tony) <5267690+ShuhaoZhangTony@users.noreply.github.com>
